! ===============================================================================
! Title: yt vaporizer v2 (Hybrid Ultra-Compatible Edition)
! Description: Combined Brute-Force (v1) & Container Cleanup (v2) for Maximum Compatibility
! Target: All Devices (Legacy & Modern / Low-end & High-end)
! ===============================================================================

! --- 1. NETWORK & SCRIPT BLOCKING (Universal Fast Execution) ---
||googleads.g.doubleclick.net^$domain=youtube.com
||static.doubleclick.net^$domain=youtube.com
||youtube.com/pagead/*
||youtube.com/ptracking$domain=youtube.com
||youtube-nocookie.com/embed/*

! --- 2. BRUTE-FORCE CSS ELEMENT HIDING (Style v1: Direct DOM Match) ---
