! --- 3. CONTAINER CLEANUP & LAYOUT REPAIR (Style v2: Grid Fix) ---
! Mengatur ulang grid YouTube agar tidak meninggalkan kotak kosong bekas iklan
youtube.com##ytd-rich-grid-row:has(ytd-display-ad-renderer):style(display: none !important;)
youtube.com##ytd-rich-item-renderer:has(ytd-display-ad-renderer):style(display: none !important;)
youtube.com##ytd-rich-item-renderer:has(ytd-ad-slot-renderer):style(display: none !important;)

! --- 4. SCRIPTLET & PROCEDURAL BYPASS (Modern Engines Only / Safe Fallback) ---
! Scriptlet ini akan diabaikan oleh adblocker lama secara aman tanpa bikin error
youtube.com##+js(set, ytInitialPlayerResponse.adPlacements, undefined)
youtube.com##+js(set, playerResponse.adPlacements, undefined)
youtube.com##+js(json-prune, adPlacements playerAds)
